            <ArticleTitle>Comorbid chronic non-cancer pain and opioid use disorders.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>210-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Patients with chronic non-cancer pain and opioid dependence are difficult to treat effectively. This article reviews the common issues that arise in relation to assessment and treatment, and recommends the adoption of an integrated approach to this patient population.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
